From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 125hz <nickfugitives@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:37:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] xinput: read Madeira host controller snapshots through win32u

Extract the XInput portion of 6befa2ba20f without its DEP/backend changes.
Add the host query, architecture-neutral state/capability payloads and WOW64
pointer widening, preserving HID fallback. Serialize host keystroke edges,
respect XInputEnable, validate output arguments and keep audio checks scoped
to the requested user. Add a standalone Windows host-path API regression test.

Requires the paired Madeira ios_gamepad_query implementation when WINE_IOS
is enabled. No submodule, binary, or unrelated fork changes.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Signed-off-by: 125hz <nickfugitives@gmail.com>
